  "notes": [
    "-IR verb with two irregularities: e→i stem change and g→j spelling change before a/o",
    "**Presente**: e→i in all forms except nosotros; g→j in yo only: *corrijo*",
    "**Pretérito Indefinido**: e→i in 3rd person only: *corrigió*, *corrigieron*",
    "**Subjuntivo**: yo form corrijo → stem corrij + -a endings; e→i applies to nosotros too: *corrijamos*",
    "Past participle: corregido (regular)",
    "*El profesor corrige los exámenes* = The teacher marks the exams",
    "*Corrígeme si me equivoco* = Correct me if I'm wrong",
    "Related: la corrección (correction), correcto/a (correct), incorrecto/a (incorrect)"
  ],
